  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-222.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>222)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　大家在工作上犯了资产阶级反动路线的错误，主要责任是制定资产阶级反动路线的人，执行的人有各种情况，要区别对待。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-221.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-223.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
